    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d2-a8">

                <pb facs="0117" n="9" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg9"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 8 in No. 353.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mercy to Mr. Grant.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Krakau</hi></placeName>. [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-03-09"
                    >undated</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Police will not give permit; can’t come to Vienna. Do all you can. Must get home.
                    Very important. Telegraph particulars my expense.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Mercy</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
